@startuml 02-arquitectura-aws
title Arquitectura desplegada de IntenCite en AWS

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45

actor "Usuario" as User
component "GitHub Actions" as Actions

cloud "AWS Academy - us-east-1" as AWS {

    database "Amazon S3\nTerraform State" as State

    node "Amazon ECR" as ECR {
        artifact "intencite-app\nNginx image" as AppImage
        artifact "intencite-api\nFastAPI + modelos" as ApiImage
    }

    rectangle "VPC" as VPC {

        node "Application Load Balancer\nHTTP :80\nIdle timeout: 120 s" as ALB

        rectangle "Target Group App\nPuerto 80" as AppTG
        rectangle "Target Group API\nPuerto 8001" as ApiTG

        node "ECS Cluster\nintencite-cluster" as ECS {

            node "Fargate Task\nintencite-app\n256 CPU / 512 MiB" as AppTask {
                component "Nginx\nFrontend estático\nPuerto 80" as Nginx
            }

            node "Fargate Task\nintencite-api\n2048 CPU / 8192 MiB" as ApiTask {
                component "FastAPI + Uvicorn\nPuerto 8001" as FastAPI

                artifact "TF-IDF +\nLogistic Regression" as Baseline

                artifact "Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n+ LoRA adapter" as Qwen
            }
        }
    }

    database "CloudWatch Logs\n/ecs/intencite-app\n/ecs/intencite-api" as Logs
}

User --> ALB : HTTP

ALB --> AppTG : /
AppTG --> Nginx : Puerto 80

ALB --> ApiTG : /api/*\n/health
ApiTG --> FastAPI : Puerto 8001

FastAPI --> Baseline : Inferencia clásica
FastAPI --> Qwen : Inferencia LoRA\nKV cache

AppImage ..> AppTask : Imagen Docker
ApiImage ..> ApiTask : Imagen Docker

AppTask --> Logs : Logs
ApiTask --> Logs : Logs

Actions ..> State : Backend Terraform
Actions ..> ECR : Push de imágenes
Actions ..> ALB : Terraform apply
Actions ..> ECS : Terraform apply\n+ force deployment

note right of ApiImage
La imagen de la API incluye
el modelo base Qwen.

HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1
TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1
end note

note bottom of ALB
El frontend solo sirve
archivos estáticos.

El ALB realiza el routing
en el ambiente AWS.
end note

@enduml